OL,3,GNEWSACharity in Capt Tom's name bids to
OL,4,Abe struck off                          
OL,6,FA charity set up by the family of      
OL,7,Frenowned pandemic fundraiser Capt Sir  
OL,8,FTom Moore has applied to be struck off.
OL,10,FThe charity is now known as the 1189808
OL,11,FFoundation, having dropped Sir Tom's   
OL,12,Fname at the request of his family last 
OL,13,Fyear.                                  
OL,15,FAn application to have it struck off   
OL,16,Fappeared on the Companies House        
OL,17,Fregister on Friday.                    
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
