OL,3,GNEWSACharity in Capt Tom's name bids to
OL,4,Abe struck off                          
OL,6,FThe World War Two veteran became a     
OL,7,Fhousehold name during the first        
OL,8,FCovid-19 lockdown, raising #39.4m for  
OL,9,FNHS charities by walking laps of the   
OL,10,Fgarden at his home in Marston          
OL,11,FMoretaine, Bedfordshire.               
